-  /* ═════════════════════════════ Native bridge ═════════════════════════════
-     window.chrome.webview is injected by WebView2. We expose a tiny RPC wrapper
-     as window.wash that returns promises. Messages from C# arrive as JSON via
-     `addEventListener("message", ...)`. */
